  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : **65 * 45 * 25 * 5 * 35 * 60**\n\n**According to the question, by replacing the *signs :**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : -, +, -, +, =\n\n​65 - 45 + 25 - 5 + 35 = 60\n\n**65 + 25 + 35**__ - 45 - 5 = 60\n\n__**125 - 45 - 5**__ = 60\n\n**75 ≠ 60 (LHS ≠ RHS) **\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : +, ×, +, -, = \n\n65 + **45 × 25**__ + 5 - 35 = 60\n\n__**65 + 1125 + 5**__ - 35 = 60\n\n__**1195 - 35**__ = 60\n\n**1160 ≠ 60 (LHS ≠ RHS) **\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : +, -, +, -, =\n\n​**65 + 45**__ - 25 + 5 - 35 = 60\n\n__**110 - 25 + 5 -**____** 35**__ = 60\n\n**55 ≠ 60 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : -, +, ÷, +, =\n\n​65 - 45 +** 25 ÷​ 5**__ + 35 = 60\n\n__**65 + 5 + 35**__ - 45 = 60\n\n__**105 - 45**__ = 60\n\n**60 = 60 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (4)\"** is the correct answer.\n\nb9:T15",
